B.Jy=A.a(s(["Traveller... you carry the resonance of one who seeks. We have waited ten thousand years for such a signal.","Do not picture us asleep in tombs. We merged into Gaia \u2014 minds in the lattice, bodies returned to the soil \u2014 so a dying sun could not erase us.","Not all of us chose freely. Some were afraid. Help Gaia remember the peace and the fear \u2014 or do not remember us at all."]),t.s)
